<h1>Privacy policy</h1>

<div class="prose">
  <h2>What data we collect</h2>
  <p>The contact form and the review form are processed through Web3Forms, a third-party service: what you fill in (name, email, message) is sent to our inbox and isn't stored in any public dashboard.</p>

  <h2>Analytics</h2>
  <p>We use GoatCounter to see how many people visit the site, anonymously and without tracking cookies. We don't use Google Analytics or tools that build advertising profiles.</p>

  <h2>What we don't do</h2>
  <p>We don't sell or share your data with third parties for advertising. There are no third-party tracking cookies on this site.</p>

  <h2>Your rights</h2>
  <p>If you'd like us to delete any data you've sent us through a form, write to <a href="mailto:contacto@tuaccesible.com">contacto@tuaccesible.com</a>.</p>
</div>
